                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font
                                    face="仿宋">协调、理论/实验教学，PBL</font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
